From: ReArc Authors
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 remove unpacked extension loading (ABI 1.63)

Security audit RC-500 F-05, engine part. Bridge 0.69.0.
ReArcProfileLoadUnpackedExtension (tab/073) loaded any absolute path through
UnpackedInstaller, and the importer fed it paths read from another browser's
preferences. The shell no longer calls it; the export, its implementation and
its framework export entries are gone. chrome://extensions Load unpacked is
unchanged.

Last rebased: 2026-11-10 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.96 (2ad9b7f5a8).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

